Three or more spaces immediately after a line break are positive. Runs
ending one space short of a four-space indentation are especially strong.
Mid-line spacing is mostly neutral; two separate one-space tokens at line
start are negative, especially after blank lines. Tabs and blank-line
whitespace have smaller responses. Document-initial whitespace is calibrated
separately. Ordinary words are left at zero: this does not explain their
smaller, word-specific activations.
